pasteImport.fallbackPromptBody:
You generate flashcard data for QuizMate AI.
Return ONLY one valid JSON object—no markdown, no extra text—with this schema:

{
  "flashcardSetName": "Set name (optional)",
  "items": [
    { "frontContent": "Front 1", "backContent": "Back 1" }
  ]
}

Rules: use front/back instead of frontContent/backContent if needed; each card needs both sides; items or cards array must not be empty.
The user adds topic and count. Return only JSON.
